<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Email Verification OTP</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background-color: #f4f7f6;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 30px auto;
      background: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }
    .header {
      text-align: center;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;
    }
    .otp-code {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: bold;
      letter-spacing: 5px;
      color: #4A90E2;
      background: #eef5fc;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      margin: 20px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #888888;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>Email Verification</h2>
    </div>
    <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
    <p>Thank you for registering. Please use the following One-Time Password (OTP) to complete your email verification. This code is valid for 2 minutes.</p>
    <div style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="otp-code"><%= otp %></div>
    </div>
    <p>If you did not request this email, please ignore it.</p>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; CloudFusion. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
